    <string name="edgego_help">Gesture guide</string>
    <string name="edgego_help_body">Start inside an enabled zone. Swipe inward, diagonally, or along the edge, then release to run its action. Hold still after a swipe for a hold action. A longer swipe selects its extended action. Return to the starting edge to cancel. Taps wait briefly when double or triple tap actions are assigned. Drawn gestures start inside the zone and use a single stroke. Bottom shortcuts sit above the system navigation area. GameSpace protection is enabled by default. Sliders follow your finger; pie control supports slide selection and tap selection. Lock screen shortcuts use the normal system unlock flow.</string>
